@title Heat legend under a lesson card: the scale lies flat, ticks are readable, the notes scroll
@area Cabinet
# The card parked in the bottom right leaves the Temperature legend little height. Its scale then lies flat with thinned ticks, and the notes below scroll (solid bar) instead of being cut off.
# After Place all is accepted the legend also gets the total-loss line, so at 1280x688 it overflows; the scroll step reaches the last note.
click_text "Learn…"
wait 15
text cabinet layout
wait 8
click_text Start #1
wait 40
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 40
key shift+h
wait 60
shot legend-at-run-size
check_blank legend-at-run-size
expect "Preview, not a solver result"
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 40
key Enter
wait 60
resize 1280 688
wait 60
shot legend-squeezed
check_blank legend-squeezed
expect "Total loss"
check_layout
scroll 1165 235 -200
wait 20
shot legend-scrolled-down
scroll 1165 235 200
wait 20
shot legend-scrolled-back
